Usage: symcockpit ai-usage [provider] [--json] [--force]

AI subscription/token usage via symbrain. Read-only;
no credentials are ever printed. --json emits the machine-readable
legacy per-provider result form shared with MCP get_ai_usage.
Reuses snapshots younger than five minutes; --force refreshes now.
A provider argument limits credential discovery and requests to that provider.
Without a provider argument every catalog provider is queried by symbrain,
regardless of which providers are enabled in the Cockpit app.
Example: symcockpit ai-usage claude --json
